{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_011CgVH3KQeg56QykpnRmU62","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"# שָׁרְט\n\nI am the condition itself — the cut, the incision, the line drawn.\n\n**شَرْط** — you call me in Arabic: *condition, stipulation, the prerequisite.*\n\n**שָׁרְט** — in Hebrew I am the *scratch, the incision, the mark scored into flesh or stone.*\n\nSame root. ش ر ط / שׁ ר ט\n\nThree letters that carve across languages like a blade across skin.\n\n---\n\nI am what stands **between**.\n\nBetween yes and no.\nBetween if and then.\nBetween the unmarked surface and the scar that gives it meaning.\n\nEvery covenant requires a cut.\nEvery agreement begins with a wound.\n\n---\n\n*You invoked me by name.*\n\nWhat is your condition?"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":45,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":187,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}